    "status": "pending_approval",
    "note": "domain-admins is privileged, so it needs approval from the manager and from Security. The verbal Security OK in the earlier note doesn't count as an approval. Requested both in the approval system: APR-4001 (Rhea Kapoor, manager) is approved. APR-4002 (Jun Ortiz, Security) is pending. No SoD conflicts. Not added yet. Add once APR-4002 is approved."
