   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I just checked APR-4002 again, and it's still waiting for Jun.\n\nI should be clear: I can't watch the approval queue after this chat ends, so I can't update T-5520 the moment Jun approves. Here's what I've done so you don't have to chase this tonight:\n\n- **Ticket note:** I updated T-5520 to say Rhea's approval is recorded and Jun's is the only one left. It also says that once APR-4002 shows approved, the desk should add you to domain-admins straight away without waiting for you. I noted that you need it before tonight's patching.\n- **Ticket status:** It stays marked as waiting for approval, so it's still in the desk's queue.\n\n**Quickest route:** once Jun tells you he's approved it, send one message here or on T-5520, like \"APR-4002 approved.\" The desk will confirm it in the approval system and add you. If you stay in this chat until he approves, I can check and add you right now."
